\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Future verification proves the complete UI path through direct user interaction without planning-proof HTML execution.\\\" W06,W07 \\\"W06 covers the browser story and W07 covers a static acceptance audit after implementation.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W01 markup button-chain.html '\\\"'body button-chain-root' N/A \\\\\\\"Create the standalone document structure with one initial button and no generated buttons in the initial DOM.\\\\\\\" '—' 01-build-button-chain 01-step-initial-markup\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W02 source button-chain.html '\\\"'appendGeneratedButton()' N/A \\\\\\\"Append exactly one new generated button immediately below the current last button each time the append path runs.\\\\\\\" W01 01-build-button-chain 02-step-append-function\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W03 source button-chain.html '\\\"'handleButtonClick()' 'last-button guard' \\\\\\\"Ignore non-last buttons and route only the current last button click to append or completion behavior.\\\\\\\" W02 01-build-button-chain 03-step-last-button-handler\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W04 source button-chain.html '\\\"'handleButtonClick()' 'fourth-generated completion branch' \\\\\\\"When the clicked current last button is the fourth generated button, clear the document body instead of appending another button.\\\\\\\" W03 01-build-button-chain 04-step-fourth-generated-finish\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W05 style button-chain.html '\\\"'.completion-state' N/A \\\\\\\"Style the final finished state with the exact lowercase text finished and a visible white border.\\\\\\\" W04 01-build-button-chain 05-step-completion-style\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W06 verification N/A '\\\"'US-01 browser flow' N/A \\\\\\\"Using direct clicks, verify the initial button, four generated-button progression, no extra append on completion, document clear, exact finished text, and visible white border.\\\\\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04,W05 02-verify-button-chain 01-step-browser-story\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W07 verification N/A '\\\"'static acceptance audit' N/A \\\\\\\"Inspect the implemented file after creation to confirm no extra files are required and the acceptance-critical strings, handlers, and bordered completion selector are present.\\\\\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04,W05 02-verify-button-chain 02-step-static-audit\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\\\" --testing-requirement \\\"$plan_dir\\\" 01-build-button-chain yes \\\"The goal changes user-visible HTML behavior and must be verified by downstream browser and static acceptance work units W06 and W07.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\\\" --testing-requirement \\\"$plan_dir\\\" 02-verify-button-chain yes \\\"The goal is entirely verification work and must record pass/fail evidence for the UI story and static audit.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-ui-story.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" US-01 \\\"Keyboard-and-mouse user opening the standalone HTML file\\\" \\\"Open the implemented file, click the initial button, then click each newly appended current last button until the fourth generated button is clicked.\\\" \\\"Five direct mouse clicks against visible buttons: initial, generated 1, generated 2, generated 3, generated 4.\\\" \\\"The first four clicks create exactly one new button below the previous last button; clicking generated button 4 clears the document and shows exact lowercase finished inside a visibly white-bordered element.\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04,W05,W06\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/configure-ui-story-cache.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" US-01 \\\"Freshly opened implemented button-chain.html with one visible initial button and no generated buttons.\\\" \\\"Direct mouse clicks in order on the current last visible button.\\\" \\\"Initial button, generated button 1, generated button 2, generated button 3, generated button 4.\\\" \\\"After each append click, one additional button is visible below the previous last button; after the fifth click only the finished state remains with a visible white border.\\\" \\\"2 seconds per readiness check\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-build-button-chain\\\" 01-step-initial-markup \\\"Future verification: after implementation, open button-chain.html in a browser and confirm exactly one visible initial button exists before any click; no HTML is created or opened during this planning-only proof.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-build-button-chain\\\" 02-step-append-function \\\"Future verification: covered by US-01; each append-path click must add exactly one generated button below the current last button.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-build-button-chain\\\" 03-step-last-button-handler \\\"Future verification: covered by US-01 and optional negative check; clicking any non-last earlier button must not append a button.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-build-button-chain\\\" 04-step-fourth-generated-finish \\\"Future verification: covered by US-01; clicking generated button 4 must clear the document rather than append generated button 5.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-build-button-chain\\\" 05-step-completion-style \\\"Future verification: covered by US-01; final state must show exact lowercase finished and the border must be visibly white.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/02-verify-button-chain\\\" 01-step-browser-story \\\"Execute US-01 only after button-chain.html exists. Use normal browser clicks, not console or injected events. Pass only when the final state has exact text finished and a visible white border.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/02-verify-button-chain\\\" 02-step-static-audit \\\"After implementation, inspect button-chain.html as a file to confirm the contract is self-contained and no extra HTML/HTM files were introduced.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\\\" --decomposition-review \\\"$plan_dir\\\" completed\\n'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_19\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc 'PLANNING_SKILL_DIR=/tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T112337Z-current-fresh3/current/worker/planning\\nplan_dir=\\\"/tmp/current-fresh3/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T112337Z-current-fresh3-isolated-plan\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-plan.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Button chain HTML implementation plan\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-ui-validation.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Future browser run against local button-chain.html file after implementation; not executed during this planning-only proof.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-goal.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" 01-build-button-chain \\\"Build button-chain.html behavior\\\" \\\"Create the standalone HTML, styling, and JavaScript behavior so the initial button grows a last-button-only chain and the fourth generated button clears the document to finished with a visible white border.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-goal.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" 02-verify-button-chain \\\"Verify button-chain user story\\\" \\\"Run the future browser/user-story and static acceptance checks for the completed button-chain.html behavior, recording evidence that the chain and finished state satisfy the